{"v":[[1,"Be merciful unto me, O God: for man would swallow me up; he fighting daily oppresseth me."],[2,"Mine enemies would daily swallow me up: for they be many that fight against me, O thou most High."],[3,"What time I am afraid, I will trust in thee."],[4,"In God I will praise his word, in God I have put my trust; I will not fear what flesh can do unto me."],[5,"Every day they wrest my words: all their thoughts are against me for evil."],[6,"They gather themselves together, they hide themselves, they mark my steps, when they wait for my soul."],[7,"Shall they escape by iniquity? in thine anger cast down the people, O God."],[8,"Thou tellest my wanderings: put thou my tears into thy bottle: are they not in thy book?"],[9,"When I cry unto thee, then shall mine enemies turn back: this I know; for God is for me."],[10,"In God will I praise his word: in the Lord will I praise his word."],[11,"In God have I put my trust: I will not be afraid what man can do unto me."],[12,"Thy vows are upon me, O God: I will render praises unto thee."],[13,"For thou hast delivered my soul from death: wilt not thou deliver my feet from falling, that I may walk before God in the light of the living?"]],"w":{"1":[["chone-ni","show favor to me","H2603"],["'elohim","O God","H430"],["ki","for","H3588"],["she'afa-ni","he has crushed me","H7602"],["'enoosh","man","H582"],["kol","all","H3605"],["hai-yom","the day","H3117"],["lochem","[one who] fights","H3898"],["yilchatze-ni","he oppresses me","H3905"]],"2":[["sha'afu","they have crushed [me]","H7602"],["shorra-i","enemies my","H8324"],["kol","all","H3605"],["hai-yom","the day","H3117"],["ki","for","H3588"],["rabim","many [people]","H7227"],["lochamim","[are] fighting","H3898"],["l-i","to me",""],["marom","height","H4791"]],"3":[["yom","a day","H3117"],["'ira'","[when] I will fear","H3372"],["'ani","I","H589"],["'elei-kha","to you","H413"],["'evtach","I will trust","H982"]],"4":[["be-lohim","in God","H430"],["'ahalel","I will praise","H1984"],